    {
      "id": "kings_hob_stone_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“No.” Emphatic. “Second face is finer. Better stone than the Kingsroad has any use for, and there is *none of it* in the Kingsroad, or the Craftrow, or the King's Gate. I have looked at every road in this vale.” A pause. “It went somewhere.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
